    "detailed_description": "Game Features:<br />\r\n1. Strategic compositing upgrades that let you indulge in mental calculations.<br />\r\n2. Sandbox style of free play, through the layout of the enemy interception, create endless possibilities.<br />\r\n3. Game leaderboards, making progress with global players<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame play:<br />\r\n1. Composition rules: More than three connected towers (of the same kind) shall be composed of advanced towers<br />\r\n2. If more than three towers are upgraded, they can get stronger attack reward, referred to as &quot;super attack Tower&quot;.<br />\r\n3. The monster starts from the lower left corner and automatically finds its way until it escapes from the upper right corner. Players should try their best<br />\r\nBuild up your firepower to defend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame items:<br />\r\nBomb: Deals direct damage to towers, enemies.<br />\r\nComposition: A tower that can intelligently transform to the appropriate level for the current environment<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntroduction of towers:<br />\r\n1. Yellow Tower, single point attack, high-speed output damage enemies<br />\r\n2. Red Cannon, range damage, secondary blast range damage to enemies<br />\r\n3. Blue Tower, range deceleration, and damage within enemy range<br />\r\n4. Green Tower, line damage, prolonged ray damage enemies<br />\r\n5. Orange Tower, range sustained damage<br />\r\n6. Purple Tower, penetrating sustained damage<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntroduction of the enemy:<br />\r\n1. Normal monsters, balanced health and speed<br />\r\n2. Speed Monster: Fast, but low blood volume<br />\r\n3. Split Monsters. The first death will split two monsters<br />\r\n4. boss, terrible health. New player killer",
    "about_the_game": "Game Features:<br />\r\n1. Strategic compositing upgrades that let you indulge in mental calculations.<br />\r\n2. Sandbox style of free play, through the layout of the enemy interception, create endless possibilities.<br />\r\n3. Game leaderboards, making progress with global players<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame play:<br />\r\n1. Composition rules: More than three connected towers (of the same kind) shall be composed of advanced towers<br />\r\n2. If more than three towers are upgraded, they can get stronger attack reward, referred to as &quot;super attack Tower&quot;.<br />\r\n3. The monster starts from the lower left corner and automatically finds its way until it escapes from the upper right corner. Players should try their best<br />\r\nBuild up your firepower to defend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame items:<br />\r\nBomb: Deals direct damage to towers, enemies.<br />\r\nComposition: A tower that can intelligently transform to the appropriate level for the current environment<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntroduction of towers:<br />\r\n1. Yellow Tower, single point attack, high-speed output damage enemies<br />\r\n2. Red Cannon, range damage, secondary blast range damage to enemies<br />\r\n3. Blue Tower, range deceleration, and damage within enemy range<br />\r\n4. Green Tower, line damage, prolonged ray damage enemies<br />\r\n5. Orange Tower, range sustained damage<br />\r\n6. Purple Tower, penetrating sustained damage<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntroduction of the enemy:<br />\r\n1. Normal monsters, balanced health and speed<br />\r\n2. Speed Monster: Fast, but low blood volume<br />\r\n3. Split Monsters. The first death will split two monsters<br />\r\n4. boss, terrible health. New player killer",
